## CORE RELATION

For TWO positive integers:

```
HCF × LCM
    =
Product of numbers
```

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

## EUCLIDEAN ALGORITHM

```
gcd(a,b)

    ↓

gcd(b, a%b)
```

until:

```
b = 0
```

