```
LCM =
(a/gcd) × b
```

Use this order to reduce overflow.

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

## RECOGNITION

```
greatest divisor
least common multiple
smallest number divisible by
greatest number dividing

    ↓

HCF / LCM
```

